    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1,
        "isblock": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Fischer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Special Forces Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oi. Pondering some question for the ages again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Special Forces Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Apologies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "While your mind has gone walkies taking in your jigsaw puzzle, that 'Harmonie' Feline has been continuing to act without pause, right here in County Trent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Special Forces Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I assure you, my mind has not wandered, and surveillance of her has not slackened an inch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The way you act tells me the investigation's not made much headway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Special Forces Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If surveillance during this stretch proves she's still loyal to her duty to Victoria, I'll be happier than if we catch a traitor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never seen you happy period.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Special Forces Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "After the failure of the last op, I thought I wouldn't see you in this office again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Special Forces Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't put it that way. The op itself wasn't a failure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And your results from the hospital?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Special Forces Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Acute infection, active Originium shards abundant in wounds...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, my condition is under control now, I assure. The occasional headaches will not impact my activities.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That said, I haven't reported the diagnosis to the superiors yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I consider myself as still able to assume the investigation into Harmonie, not to mention nobody would want to take over the scraps of info on this region.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is a true goal behind these smokebombs, and I have a duty to find it out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I assure, I will maintain a distance from all others during this period.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "With my experience handling emergency situations, you didn't even need to add that last part.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Special Forces Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We of the Special Forces will continue supporting your investigation, as long as the city hall still lets you in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Special Forces Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not going to say thanks?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Special Forces Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, never mind that. I'm just cracking a joke. Trying to untense your muscles for once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Special Forces Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Find some time to read the Viscount's letter, remember.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Special Forces Captain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "An invitation card?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
