        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "34_g1_victoriavillage",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen to you? Where are you going to take us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't keep wandering in these wastes anymore. There's no settlements along the way you're pointing us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can forget picking berries in a place as lifeless as this, let alone hunting wild beasts. And besides, you don't know if the rain's going to pelt us with stones one day! No Catastrophe Messenger ever heads through there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know exactly how many days it takes to cross the marsh. Food-wise, we plunder a Victorian caravan and job's done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, and that doctor's got enough medicine for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's not a doctor... and she's headed to a town herself. We agreed she'd part ways after escorting us to one, even. What do you take her for? A personal first-aid kit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone's got to throw everything they've got in with you, lives included, all because you want to be a little bit selfish, yeah? Am I wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up, Fionn! If you've got a problem, why don't you go off yourself? You think you can handle that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cowards don't survive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Selmon!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, 'Reed'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know how much I hate your nickname? It's like rocks and mud, all over the ground. I don't even know if I'm talking to you or the grass we walk by, haha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard you two arguing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's... I have to tell you something. We can't go to Tulla village.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The airwaves just said. The army suspects two factories there of secretly producing supplies for Dublinn. They drove out a bunch of people. A whole clash sparked off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll keep heading that direction for now. Forget catching the carrier... we'll probably get seized the moment we approach the village.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...*sigh* It's a miracle we got someone so capable to help us. Just barely made it out here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, you say that like you'll flag down a carrier and the good days'll come.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Escape from a factory into a mine somewhere else, until one lucky day a truck takes you somewhere other than Tara... You think that'll be a cakewalk?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know of a lot who've fled that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You saw them leave, that's all. Because their village went up in smoke, because they couldn't put crops in any wasteland around. THAT'S why they left. And you don't even know where they finished up, or if they did it alive or dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And, do you even know where Tara is, or how far you go before you've escaped? They've never shown that on a map.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop trying to scare me with all these big questions! Does it make you right just because I can't answer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget\u2014forget it. I'll go talk with an old acquaintance here about borrowing some dry rations. *sigh* It's like all that blabbing you do's going to conjure up enough food to feed the dozen of us tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "300,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's... very hurt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No shit. He doesn't like telling lies, but he's got to come up with some porkies if he wants to borrow stuff. I'll be back, I can repay you, things like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go and help him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You talk too much like those Victorian officers from other parts. They won't trust you. Or are you just that good at lying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just\u2014don't like having to rob others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And\u2014I don't... like your selfishness either. It's the greatest lie of them all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
