    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "34_g1_victoriavillage",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "You're sure your friend said he saw Dublinn around here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why else wouldn't we be passing through here? Word spread among all the caravans. Everyone's opting to go the long way around just to avoid this belt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Caravan Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We wouldn't even have come here... if you hadn't vowed so solemnly we'd be fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Caravan Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? But we're almost to your destination, and we haven't seen a thing yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Erm, it did happen some days ago. There's a chance they're further off by now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Caravan Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I heard was Dublinn were scrambling on their way, so much they never even turned to look properly at my friend's caravan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Caravan Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh. How many heads did he count? Which direction were they off in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That way. Off into uninhabited wastes. As for how many, he said he couldn't count properly, and didn't dare to either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Caravan Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've got no reason to lie to you, madams. We've got nothing to fear at all save those armed Dublinn bastards, and your average Taran hoodlums.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Caravan Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Poor places are always crawling with bandits or what have you. We have security measures in place, I can guarantee you that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Caravan Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the time we found out County Oak Grove was migrating far and us caravans'd have to alter course through here, I'd already spent a hefty sum arming and armoring my people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Caravan Head"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on a min, Chenchen... look over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's... someone dressed a lot like Dublinn there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_snowconutryinside",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
