        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fie, I tell you. That new tax ordinance they just announced, it's murder. None of us were so hard up in times before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skint Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fionn, foreign madam, I'd love to be able to help you... but I'm living on pennies these days too, and you can laugh if you want.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skint Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "On the one hand, you want to feed a dozen or so a meal each, and that's not nothing. On the other hand, you've got all these people with working limbs and working energy. You're best off coming up with your own solution.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skint Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know they've been sounding lights-out for years on the Sc\u00e1thanna Fields exactly to hold off the starving, to stop us stealing some noble's prey, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Faff. Who gives a toss about rules when you're starving for real? If you're just counting purely on others to help your need, I say you were born eating your head off!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skint Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no, no, never... They're all law-abiders, come on, that's why I'm even asking for a bite to eat on their behalf...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Maybe, I can do you something if you've got collateral.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skint Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Fionn, but verbal guarantees don't do no use now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skint Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$book_close"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A book? That's not gonna do it, madam. Not sure I'd even trust this to prop up my bed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skint Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, is anyone in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Worn Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skint Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That sick woman's here begging again. Does me in. You open the door for her, she'll be leaning on the frame talking your head off for an hour straight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skint Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leaning on the frame! She's an Infected! I'm scared she's gonna have my house's doorframe growing stones!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skint Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Faff and all, those bloody beggars. I thought last winter might well've starved them to death... Shame they caught ill, but who asked them to loiter all over pestering people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skint Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "One sec, though, that voice... No, it can't be? But I wouldn't mistake it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fionn, do you recognize her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_421_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I\u2014I don't know... *sigh* Better not peek from the window...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_armycrowd",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "b",
        "volume": 0.3
