    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop waiting. We doss around any more and the caravan's gonna pass us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tempersome Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm willing to bet Fionn's not getting us food this time. Laughing stock he makes of himself asking and asking, doesn't even realize it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tempersome Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those Victorians sneer at us day in, day out. What's a single bit of robbery to us or them? Weren't we gonna join Dublinn and fight the Victorians anyway?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tempersome Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But. But Reed might get angry with us. Doing something like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwrought Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let her. Shouldn't we loot while we still have the energy to fight people? You want to wait until our heads are spinning before we do it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tempersome Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "And this is the first caravan we've seen in all these days. Who knows when the next chance'll come?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tempersome Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then. Maybe if we convince Reed to spring them with us? Then at least our chances of winning are a little better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwrought Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough, stop bringing her up. What we're doing has nothing to do with her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you going to count on her, a foreigner, saving us forever?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Move. We're doing this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
